window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>Chorus of Thieves</i></b><b> is an action-packed fantasy with friendship at its heart.</b></p> <p>Melody and Enrick are mercenaries at the tail end of a job. It's hard to make a living in a land of corrupt kings, horrifying monsters, and fallen gods. So, whenever they are offered a chance at a score in the dazzling, coastal city of Tarmassa that promises riches and revenge, they do not hesitate.</p> <p>But what they find in that city is worth far more than gold or vindication. And it could lead to dangers beyond their wildest dreams.</p> <p><i>Chorus of Thieves</i> marks the start of a new series inspired by classic sword and sorcery fiction, such as Robert E. Howard's <i>Conan</i>, but with modern writing influences that include Joe Abercrombie, Nicholas Eames, and Christopher Buehlman.</p>"; 
